      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tunica_Resorts%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 2011 Mississippi River floods damaged casino resort buildings and infrastructure, but the floating casinos largely escaped damage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tunica_Resorts%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "As of 2025, Tunica Resorts hosts five casinos, down from eleven at its peak, reflecting industry consolidation.",
